\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 Peppered between tourism photos are posts with more obvious propaganda. One video titled \u8220 What foreigners in BEIJING think of the CPC and their life in China?" features Zang interviewing foreigners in China who gush about the Chinese Communist Party and insist they're not surveilled by the government the way outsiders might think.}
